<!-- sections/product__main.liquid -->
{% comment %}
  Loop through different blocks to create a product page.

  Globals:
    - settings.layout_horizontal: horizontaly margin
    - settings.thumbmails_color_scheme: set color of items

  Possible enhancements:
    - Add alternative layouts
    - Add support so upsell can fit within form

  Pro tips:
    - Multiple product templates can be created from the theme editor.

  ================================================================
  DESIGN REFACTOR — merchant-controlled typography, color, spacing,
  borders, and sizing from the theme editor. Controls are layered
  as OPTIONAL overrides on top of the existing color scheme, token
  classes, and block spacing — every new setting defaults to blank
  / 0 / "Default" so the live page renders IDENTICALLY until a
  merchant opts in. Breakpoint: 749px. Scope: `#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}`.
  ================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} ============ Reviews & stars (Okendo) — global overrides ============ {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  These rules target Okendo's `.oke-*` classes directly. Not scoped to
  this section because the review widget renders in a separate `apps`
  section further down the PDP. Okendo classes are unique enough that
  targeting them globally on the PDP is safe.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The PDP gallery used to be position: sticky on desktop, with the
  top offset (pdp_sticky_top) computed from the header height plus a
  24px rail gap. That sticky behavior was removed because it ignored
  the section's padding settings and visually "snapped" the gallery
  to a viewport anchor. No CSS variable is emitted on the <section>
  any more; the previous --pdp-sticky-top has no consumers.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  {% if section.settings.stars_color_filled != blank %}
    .oke-stars-foreground svg use,
    .oke-stars-foreground svg path,
    .oke-stars-foreground svg { color: {{ section.settings.stars_color_filled }} !important; fill: {{ section.settings.stars_color_filled }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.stars_color_empty != blank %}
    .oke-stars-background svg use,
    .oke-stars-background svg path,
    .oke-stars-background svg { color: {{ section.settings.stars_color_empty }} !important; fill: {{ section.settings.stars_color_empty }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.stars_size and section.settings.stars_size > 0 %}
    .oke-stars svg,
    .oke-stars-background svg,
    .oke-stars-foreground svg {
      height: {{ section.settings.stars_size }}px !important;
      width: auto !important;
    }
  {% endif %}
  {%- comment -%}
    Star shape override. We hide Okendo's <use> SVG glyphs and re-render the
    bar with a CSS mask using our own polygon. Each star is a 16.6 × 14
    tile (matches Okendo's pitch) repeated horizontally. The background SVG
    becomes the empty-star bar, the foreground SVG becomes the filled one
    (clipped by Okendo's existing percentage-width logic).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Star shape override. Hide Okendo's <use> glyphs and re-render the bar
    with a CSS mask. The mask is a single SVG containing all 5 stars at
    Okendo's exact x-positions (0, 16.6, 33.2, 49.8, 66.4) inside a 81×14
    viewBox — matching Okendo's layout 1:1 so the 5th star never clips
    and the foreground percentage-width clipping (used to show partial
    fills like 4.8 stars) keeps working.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if section.settings.stars_shape == 'sharp' or section.settings.stars_shape == 'spiky' %}
    .oke-stars-background svg use,
    .oke-stars-foreground svg use { display: none !important; }
    .oke-stars-background svg,
    .oke-stars-foreground svg {
      {% if section.settings.stars_shape == 'sharp' %}
      -webkit-mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 81 14'><polygon points='7,1 8.4,5.5 13.2,5.5 9.4,8.5 10.8,13 7,10.2 3.2,13 4.6,8.5 0.8,5.5 5.6,5.5'/><polygon points='23.6,1 25,5.5 29.8,5.5 26,8.5 27.4,13 23.6,10.2 19.8,13 21.2,8.5 17.4,5.5 22.2,5.5'/><polygon points='40.2,1 41.6,5.5 46.4,5.5 42.6,8.5 44,13 40.2,10.2 36.4,13 37.8,8.5 34,5.5 38.8,5.5'/><polygon points='56.8,1 58.2,5.5 63,5.5 59.2,8.5 60.6,13 56.8,10.2 53,13 54.4,8.5 50.6,5.5 55.4,5.5'/><polygon points='73.4,1 74.8,5.5 79.6,5.5 75.8,8.5 77.2,13 73.4,10.2 69.6,13 71,8.5 67.2,5.5 72,5.5'/></svg>") no-repeat left center / 100% 100%;
              mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 81 14'><polygon points='7,1 8.4,5.5 13.2,5.5 9.4,8.5 10.8,13 7,10.2 3.2,13 4.6,8.5 0.8,5.5 5.6,5.5'/><polygon points='23.6,1 25,5.5 29.8,5.5 26,8.5 27.4,13 23.6,10.2 19.8,13 21.2,8.5 17.4,5.5 22.2,5.5'/><polygon points='40.2,1 41.6,5.5 46.4,5.5 42.6,8.5 44,13 40.2,10.2 36.4,13 37.8,8.5 34,5.5 38.8,5.5'/><polygon points='56.8,1 58.2,5.5 63,5.5 59.2,8.5 60.6,13 56.8,10.2 53,13 54.4,8.5 50.6,5.5 55.4,5.5'/><polygon points='73.4,1 74.8,5.5 79.6,5.5 75.8,8.5 77.2,13 73.4,10.2 69.6,13 71,8.5 67.2,5.5 72,5.5'/></svg>") no-repeat left center / 100% 100%;
      {% elsif section.settings.stars_shape == 'spiky' %}
      -webkit-mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 81 14'><polygon points='7,0 8.3,5.4 14.4,5.4 9.4,8.7 11.2,14 7,10.4 2.8,14 4.6,8.7 -0.4,5.4 5.7,5.4'/><polygon points='23.6,0 24.9,5.4 31,5.4 26,8.7 27.8,14 23.6,10.4 19.4,14 21.2,8.7 16.2,5.4 22.3,5.4'/><polygon points='40.2,0 41.5,5.4 47.6,5.4 42.6,8.7 44.4,14 40.2,10.4 36,14 37.8,8.7 32.8,5.4 38.9,5.4'/><polygon points='56.8,0 58.1,5.4 64.2,5.4 59.2,8.7 61,14 56.8,10.4 52.6,14 54.4,8.7 49.4,5.4 55.5,5.4'/><polygon points='73.4,0 74.7,5.4 80.8,5.4 75.8,8.7 77.6,14 73.4,10.4 69.2,14 71,8.7 66,5.4 72.1,5.4'/></svg>") no-repeat left center / 100% 100%;
              mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 81 14'><polygon points='7,0 8.3,5.4 14.4,5.4 9.4,8.7 11.2,14 7,10.4 2.8,14 4.6,8.7 -0.4,5.4 5.7,5.4'/><polygon points='23.6,0 24.9,5.4 31,5.4 26,8.7 27.8,14 23.6,10.4 19.4,14 21.2,8.7 16.2,5.4 22.3,5.4'/><polygon points='40.2,0 41.5,5.4 47.6,5.4 42.6,8.7 44.4,14 40.2,10.4 36,14 37.8,8.7 32.8,5.4 38.9,5.4'/><polygon points='56.8,0 58.1,5.4 64.2,5.4 59.2,8.7 61,14 56.8,10.4 52.6,14 54.4,8.7 49.4,5.4 55.5,5.4'/><polygon points='73.4,0 74.7,5.4 80.8,5.4 75.8,8.7 77.6,14 73.4,10.4 69.2,14 71,8.7 66,5.4 72.1,5.4'/></svg>") no-repeat left center / 100% 100%;
      {% endif %}
      display: block;
    }
    .oke-stars-background svg { background-color: {{ section.settings.stars_color_empty | default: '#d8d8d8' }} !important; }
    .oke-stars-foreground svg { background-color: {{ section.settings.stars_color_filled | default: '#1a1a1a' }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  /* Okendo CSS variable overrides — most reliable way to restyle the widget. */
  .oke-css-vars,
  .oke-w,
  [data-oke-reviews-widget] {
    {% if section.settings.reviews_text_color  != blank %}--oke-text-color: {{ section.settings.reviews_text_color }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.reviews_border_color != blank %}--oke-border-color: {{ section.settings.reviews_border_color }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.reviews_border_radius and section.settings.reviews_border_radius > 0 %}--oke-border-radius: {{ section.settings.reviews_border_radius }}px !important;{% endif %}
    {% case section.settings.reviews_font %}
      {% when 'body'        %}--oke-base-font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;   --oke-button-font: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
      {% when 'heading'     %}--oke-base-font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important; --oke-button-font: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
      {% when 'handwritten' %}--oke-base-font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important; --oke-button-font: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important;
    {% endcase %}
    {% if section.settings.reviews_btn_bg     != blank %}--oke-button-background: {{ section.settings.reviews_btn_bg }} !important; --oke-button-background-color: {{ section.settings.reviews_btn_bg }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.reviews_btn_text   != blank %}--oke-button-text: {{ section.settings.reviews_btn_text }} !important; --oke-button-text-color: {{ section.settings.reviews_btn_text }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.reviews_btn_border != blank %}--oke-button-border: {{ section.settings.reviews_btn_border }} !important; --oke-button-border-color: {{ section.settings.reviews_btn_border }} !important;{% endif %}
  }
  {% if section.settings.reviews_btn_radius and section.settings.reviews_btn_radius > 0 %}
    .oke-button { border-radius: {{ section.settings.reviews_btn_radius }}px !important; }
  {% endif %}
  /* Customer Reviews heading */
  {% if section.settings.reviews_section_heading_color != blank %}
    .oke-w-header-title, .oke-w-header h2, [data-oke-reviews-widget] h2 { color: {{ section.settings.reviews_section_heading_color }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.reviews_section_heading_size and section.settings.reviews_section_heading_size > 0 %}
    .oke-w-header-title, .oke-w-header h2, [data-oke-reviews-widget] h2 { font-size: {{ section.settings.reviews_section_heading_size }}px !important; }
  {% endif %}
  /* Big rating number (review summary score) */
  {% if section.settings.reviews_summary_score_color != blank %}
    .oke-w-summary-rating-value, .oke-w-summary-stars-rating-value { color: {{ section.settings.reviews_summary_score_color }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.reviews_summary_score_size and section.settings.reviews_summary_score_size > 0 %}
    .oke-w-summary-rating-value, .oke-w-summary-stars-rating-value { font-size: {{ section.settings.reviews_summary_score_size }}px !important; }
  {% endif %}
  /* Helpful vote button */
  {% if section.settings.reviews_helpful_color != blank %}
    .oke-helpful-vote-button, .oke-helpful-vote-counter { color: {{ section.settings.reviews_helpful_color }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  /* Filter / sort dropdown */
  {% if section.settings.reviews_filter_bg != blank %}
    .oke-filter-background, .oke-filter, .oke-filter-search { background-color: {{ section.settings.reviews_filter_bg }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.reviews_filter_border != blank %}
    .oke-filter-border, .oke-filter { border-color: {{ section.settings.reviews_filter_border }} !important; }
  {% endif %}
  /* Inline rating count next to product title (.pdp-rating-count) */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-rating-count {
    {% case section.settings.inline_count_font %}
      {% when 'body'        %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
      {% when 'heading'     %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
      {% when 'handwritten' %}font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important;
    {% endcase %}
    {% if section.settings.inline_count_size_d and section.settings.inline_count_size_d > 0 %}font-size: {{ section.settings.inline_count_size_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.inline_count_weight != blank %}font-weight: {{ section.settings.inline_count_weight }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.inline_count_case != blank %}text-transform: {{ section.settings.inline_count_case }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.inline_count_ls != blank %}letter-spacing: {{ section.settings.inline_count_ls }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.inline_count_opacity and section.settings.inline_count_opacity > 0 %}opacity: {{ section.settings.inline_count_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.inline_count_color != blank %}color: {{ section.settings.inline_count_color }} !important;{% endif %}
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-rating-count {
      {% if section.settings.inline_count_size_m and section.settings.inline_count_size_m > 0 %}font-size: {{ section.settings.inline_count_size_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
    }
  }
</style>

{%- comment -%} ============ Section-level design CSS ============ {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    {% if section.settings.section_bg_color != blank %}background: {{ section.settings.section_bg_color }} !important;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.section_text_color != blank %}color: {{ section.settings.section_text_color }} !important;{% endif %}
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.section_pad_top_d | default: 0 }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.section_pad_bot_d | default: 0 }}px;
    {% if section.settings.section_max_width and section.settings.section_max_width > 0 %}
      max-width: {{ section.settings.section_max_width }}px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    {% endif %}
  }

  /* Gallery layout controls */
  {% if section.settings.gallery_image_bg != blank %}
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col .pc-media__frame,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col .pdp-gallery-track > div,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col [data-pc-media] .pc-media__frame {
      background: {{ section.settings.gallery_image_bg }} !important;
    }
  {% endif %}
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col .pc-media__frame,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col .pdp-gallery-track > div {
      padding: {{ section.settings.gallery_image_pad_d | default: 0 }}px !important;
    }
    {% if section.settings.gallery_col_gap_d and section.settings.gallery_col_gap_d > 0 %}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col {
        padding-right: {{ section.settings.gallery_col_gap_d }}px;
      }
    {% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.details_pad_d and section.settings.details_pad_d > 0 %}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-details-col {
        padding-left: {{ section.settings.details_pad_d }}px;
        padding-right: {{ section.settings.details_pad_d }}px;
      }
    {% endif %}
    /* Thumbnail strip width override */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-thumb-col {
      flex-basis: {{ section.settings.gallery_thumb_width_d | default: 10 }}% !important;
      max-height: {{ section.settings.gallery_thumb_max_h_d | default: 500 }}px !important;
      gap: {{ section.settings.gallery_thumb_gap | default: 8 }}px !important;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-main-col {
      flex-basis: calc(100% - {{ section.settings.gallery_thumb_width_d | default: 10 }}% - {{ section.settings.gallery_thumb_gap | default: 8 }}px) !important;
      margin-left: {{ section.settings.gallery_thumb_gap | default: 8 }}px;
    }
    /* Hide borders on non-selected thumbnails — only the selected one shows a border */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-thumb-col > div:not(.color__border-selected-1) {
      border-color: transparent !important;
    }
    /* Selected/last-hovered thumbnail gets a subtle dark overlay */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-thumb-col > div.pdp-thumb--active::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: background 0.15s ease;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col .pc-media__frame,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col .pdp-gallery-track > div {
      padding: {{ section.settings.gallery_image_pad_m | default: 0 }}px !important;
    }
    {% if section.settings.gallery_col_gap_m and section.settings.gallery_col_gap_m > 0 %}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-col {
        margin-bottom: {{ section.settings.gallery_col_gap_m }}px;
      }
    {% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.details_pad_m and section.settings.details_pad_m > 0 %}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-details-col {
        padding-left: {{ section.settings.details_pad_m }}px;
        padding-right: {{ section.settings.details_pad_m }}px;
      }
    {% endif %}
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.section_pad_top_m | default: 0 }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.section_pad_bot_m | default: 0 }}px;
    }
  }
  {% if section.settings.blocks_gap_d and section.settings.blocks_gap_d > 0 %}
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} [data-pdp-block] { margin-bottom: {{ section.settings.blocks_gap_d }}px; }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.blocks_gap_m and section.settings.blocks_gap_m > 0 %}
    @media (max-width: 749px) {
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} [data-pdp-block] { margin-bottom: {{ section.settings.blocks_gap_m }}px; }
    }
  {% endif %}

  {%- comment -%} ----- Gallery: full-width modes ----- {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if section.settings.gallery_full_width_m %}
    @media (max-width: 749px) {
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-track {
        padding-left: 0 !important;
        padding-right: 0 !important;
        gap: 0 !important;
        /* The theme's bundled Tailwind ships .snap-x but not
         * .snap-mandatory — the strictness var defaults to
         * 'proximity', so without this override swipes could stop
         * between slides. Force mandatory + stop-always so each
         * touch release lands on a slide boundary. */
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory !important;
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-track > div {
        width: 100% !important;
        scroll-snap-align: start !important;
        scroll-snap-stop: always !important;
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-track > div .border--radius {
        border-radius: 0 !important;
      }
    }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.gallery_full_width_d %}
    @media (min-width: 750px) {
      /* Mobile slider (rare on desktop, but covered for safety) */
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-track > div {
        width: 100% !important;
        scroll-snap-align: start !important;
      }
      /* Desktop grid — force single-column so each image is full container width */
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-grid-d {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  {%- comment -%} ----- Gallery dots -----
       Two visual modes:
         • filled    — inactive dots are solid color with reduced opacity
         • outlined  — inactive dots are hollow rings (border-only), Allbirds-style
       Active dot is always solid (filled) regardless of inactive style.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-dots {
    bottom: {{ section.settings.dots_bottom_offset | default: 16 }}px !important;
    gap: {{ section.settings.dots_gap | default: 8 }}px !important;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-dot {
    {% case section.settings.dots_shape %}
      {% when 'circle' %}
        width: {{ section.settings.dots_size | default: 6 }}px !important;
        height: {{ section.settings.dots_size | default: 6 }}px !important;
        border-radius: 50% !important;
      {% when 'square' %}
        width: {{ section.settings.dots_size | default: 6 }}px !important;
        height: {{ section.settings.dots_size | default: 6 }}px !important;
        border-radius: 0 !important;
    {% endcase %}
    {% if section.settings.dots_inactive_style == 'outlined' %}
      background-color: transparent !important;
      border: {{ section.settings.dots_border_width | default: 1 }}px solid {{ section.settings.dots_color | default: 'currentColor' }} !important;
      opacity: 1 !important;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    {% else %}
      {% if section.settings.dots_color != blank %}background-color: {{ section.settings.dots_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      opacity: {{ section.settings.dots_opacity | default: 35 | divided_by: 100.0 }} !important;
      border: 0 !important;
    {% endif %}
    transition: width 0.15s ease, height 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-gallery-dot.pdp-gallery-dot--active {
    {% if section.settings.dots_shape != 'default' %}
      width: {{ section.settings.dots_active_size | default: 8 }}px !important;
      height: {{ section.settings.dots_active_size | default: 8 }}px !important;
    {% endif %}
    opacity: 1 !important;
    border: 0 !important;
    {% if section.settings.dots_color_active != blank %}background-color: {{ section.settings.dots_color_active }} !important;{% endif %}
  }

  {%- comment -%} ----- Icon block layout: stacked vs inline -----
       Each icon block is rendered as <nav class="px-4" style="padding-top:X; padding-bottom:Y">.
       In inline mode:
         • flatten the per-block vertical padding (otherwise icons stagger
           vertically because each block has different spacing_top/bottom)
         • zero the horizontal padding so the merchant-set gap_d/m setting
           is the only horizontal spacing between icons
         • align-items: center so the glyph + label sit on the same baseline
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if section.settings.icon_layout == 'inline' %}
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon {
      display: inline-flex !important;
      align-items: center !important;
      width: auto !important;
      padding-top: 4px !important;
      padding-bottom: 4px !important;
      padding-left: 0 !important;
      padding-right: 0 !important;
      margin-right: {{ section.settings.icon_layout_gap_d | default: 16 }}px;
      margin-top: 0 !important;
      margin-bottom: 0 !important;
      vertical-align: middle;
      line-height: 1.2 !important;
    }
    @media (max-width: 749px) {
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon {
        margin-right: {{ section.settings.icon_layout_gap_m | default: 12 }}px;
      }
    }
    /* Give the first icon some breathing room from the left edge of the
       container (since each icon's own padding is now 0). Suppressed when
       alignment is center / right since margin-left would shift the row. */
    {% if section.settings.icon_align_d == '' or section.settings.icon_align_d == 'left' %}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon:first-of-type {
        margin-left: 16px;
      }
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  {%- comment -%}
    Icon columns (stacked layout only) — lays consecutive icon blocks
    out in a 2-up grid. Each nav becomes an inline-flex box at ~half
    width so pairs share a row; following non-icon blocks naturally
    start on a new line. vertical-align: top keeps a pair's rows
    aligned when one label wraps to two lines. The icons keep their
    own px-4 left padding so column 1 stays flush with the other
    left-justified blocks in the section.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if section.settings.icon_layout != 'inline' %}
    {% if section.settings.icon_columns_d == '2' %}
      @media (min-width: 750px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon {
          display: inline-flex !important;
          vertical-align: top;
          width: calc(50% - 4px) !important;
          box-sizing: border-box;
        }
      }
    {% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.icon_columns_m == '2' %}
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon {
          display: inline-flex !important;
          vertical-align: top;
          width: calc(50% - 4px) !important;
          box-sizing: border-box;
        }
      }
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  {%- comment -%}
    Icon alignment — works for both stacked and inline layouts. In stacked
    mode each icon block is its own flex row, so we center the glyph+label
    within the row by adjusting `justify-content` on the nav. In inline
    mode the whole row of icons is wrapped in the form's content area, so
    we apply `text-align` on the parent to push all the inline-flex icons
    together.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if section.settings.icon_align_d != blank %}
    @media (min-width: 750px) {
      {% if section.settings.icon_layout == 'inline' %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} form { text-align: {{ section.settings.icon_align_d }} !important; }
        {% if section.settings.icon_align_d != 'left' %}
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon:first-of-type { margin-left: 0 !important; }
        {% endif %}
      {% else %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon {
          justify-content:
            {% case section.settings.icon_align_d %}
              {% when 'center' %}center
              {% when 'right'  %}flex-end
              {% else %}flex-start
            {% endcase %} !important;
        }
      {% endif %}
    }
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.icon_align_m != blank %}
    @media (max-width: 749px) {
      {% if section.settings.icon_layout == 'inline' %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} form { text-align: {{ section.settings.icon_align_m }} !important; }
        {% if section.settings.icon_align_m != 'left' %}
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon:first-of-type { margin-left: 0 !important; }
        {% endif %}
      {% else %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--icon {
          justify-content:
            {% case section.settings.icon_align_m %}
              {% when 'center' %}center
              {% when 'right'  %}flex-end
              {% else %}flex-start
            {% endcase %} !important;
        }
      {% endif %}
    }
  {% endif %}

  {%- comment -%} ============ Per-block design CSS ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}

    {%- comment -%} ----- Title block ----- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.type == 'title' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-title {
        {% case block.settings.title_font %}
          {% when 'body'        %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
          {% when 'heading'     %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
          {% when 'handwritten' %}font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important;
        {% endcase %}
        {% if block.settings.title_size_d and block.settings.title_size_d > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.title_weight != blank %}font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_weight }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.title_lh and block.settings.title_lh > 0 %}line-height: {{ block.settings.title_lh }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.title_ls != blank %}letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.title_ls }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.title_case != blank %}text-transform: {{ block.settings.title_case }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.title_align_d != blank %}text-align: {{ block.settings.title_align_d }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.title_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.title_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-title {
          {% if block.settings.title_size_m and block.settings.title_size_m > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.title_align_m != blank %}text-align: {{ block.settings.title_align_m }} !important;{% endif %}
        }
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-title-subtitle,
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-title-subtitle * {
        {% case block.settings.subtitle_font %}
          {% when 'body'        %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
          {% when 'heading'     %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
          {% when 'handwritten' %}font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important;
        {% endcase %}
        {% if block.settings.subtitle_size_d and block.settings.subtitle_size_d > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subtitle_weight != blank %}font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_weight }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subtitle_lh and block.settings.subtitle_lh > 0 %}line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle_lh }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subtitle_ls != blank %}letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subtitle_ls }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subtitle_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-title-subtitle,
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-title-subtitle * {
          {% if block.settings.subtitle_size_m and block.settings.subtitle_size_m > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
        }
      }
      {% if block.settings.mb_d and block.settings.mb_d > 0 %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--title { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_d }}px; }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.mb_m and block.settings.mb_m > 0 %}
        @media (max-width: 749px) {
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-block--title { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_m }}px; }
        }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.rating_gap_d and block.settings.rating_gap_d > 0 %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-rating { margin-top: {{ block.settings.rating_gap_d }}px !important; }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.rating_gap_m and block.settings.rating_gap_m > 0 %}
        @media (max-width: 749px) {
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-rating { margin-top: {{ block.settings.rating_gap_m }}px !important; }
        }
      {% endif %}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ----- Price block ----- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.type == 'price' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-price-regular {
        {% case block.settings.price_font %}
          {% when 'body'        %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
          {% when 'heading'     %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
          {% when 'handwritten' %}font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important;
        {% endcase %}
        {% if block.settings.price_size_d and block.settings.price_size_d > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.price_weight != blank %}font-weight: {{ block.settings.price_weight }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.price_case != blank %}text-transform: {{ block.settings.price_case }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.price_ls != blank %}letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.price_ls }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.price_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.price_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-price-compare {
        {% if block.settings.compare_size_d and block.settings.compare_size_d > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.compare_size_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.compare_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.compare_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-price-regular {
          {% if block.settings.price_size_m and block.settings.price_size_m > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-price-compare {
          {% if block.settings.compare_size_m and block.settings.compare_size_m > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.compare_size_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
        }
      }
      /* Sale badge — inline price snippet renders badges via component__badge */
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-price .border__button--radius {
        {% if block.settings.sale_bg != blank %}background: {{ block.settings.sale_bg }} !important; border-color: {{ block.settings.sale_bg }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.sale_text_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.sale_text_color }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.sale_radius and block.settings.sale_radius > 0 %}border-radius: {{ block.settings.sale_radius }}px !important;{% endif %}
      }
      {% if block.settings.mb_d and block.settings.mb_d > 0 %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-price { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_d }}px; }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.mb_m and block.settings.mb_m > 0 %}
        @media (max-width: 749px) { #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-price { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_m }}px; } }
      {% endif %}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ----- Options block ----- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.type == 'options' -%}
      /* Option labels */
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options label {
        {% case block.settings.opt_label_font %}
          {% when 'body'        %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
          {% when 'heading'     %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
          {% when 'handwritten' %}font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important;
        {% endcase %}
        {% if block.settings.opt_label_size_d and block.settings.opt_label_size_d > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.opt_label_size_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.opt_label_weight != blank %}font-weight: {{ block.settings.opt_label_weight }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.opt_label_case != blank %}text-transform: {{ block.settings.opt_label_case }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.opt_label_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.opt_label_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options label {
          {% if block.settings.opt_label_size_m and block.settings.opt_label_size_m > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.opt_label_size_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
        }
      }
      /* Swatches — target .btn.btn--plain inside options (swatch-rendered buttons) */
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn.btn--plain {
        {% if block.settings.swatch_size_d and block.settings.swatch_size_d > 0 %}
          width: {{ block.settings.swatch_size_d }}px !important;
          height: {{ block.settings.swatch_size_d }}px !important;
          min-width: {{ block.settings.swatch_size_d }}px !important;
          min-height: {{ block.settings.swatch_size_d }}px !important;
        {% endif %}
        {% case block.settings.swatch_shape %}
          {% when 'square'  %}border-radius: 0 !important;
          {% when 'rounded' %}border-radius: 6px !important;
        {% endcase %}
        {% if block.settings.swatch_border_width and block.settings.swatch_border_width > 0 %}border-width: {{ block.settings.swatch_border_width }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.swatch_border_color != blank %}border-color: {{ block.settings.swatch_border_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn.btn--plain.color__border-selected-1,
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn.btn--plain[aria-pressed="true"] {
        {% if block.settings.swatch_border_selected != blank %}border-color: {{ block.settings.swatch_border_selected }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .flex.flex-wrap {
        {% if block.settings.swatch_gap_d and block.settings.swatch_gap_d > 0 %}gap: {{ block.settings.swatch_gap_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
      }
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn.btn--plain {
          {% if block.settings.swatch_size_m and block.settings.swatch_size_m > 0 %}
            width: {{ block.settings.swatch_size_m }}px !important;
            height: {{ block.settings.swatch_size_m }}px !important;
            min-width: {{ block.settings.swatch_size_m }}px !important;
          {% endif %}
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .flex.flex-wrap {
          {% if block.settings.swatch_gap_m and block.settings.swatch_gap_m > 0 %}gap: {{ block.settings.swatch_gap_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
        }
      }
      /* Option buttons (non-swatch variants like Size) */
      {% if block.settings.opt_btn_radius and block.settings.opt_btn_radius > 0 %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn--secondary { border-radius: {{ block.settings.opt_btn_radius }}px !important; }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.opt_btn_bg_selected != blank %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn--secondary[aria-pressed="true"],
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn--secondary.color__bg-selected-1 {
          background: {{ block.settings.opt_btn_bg_selected }} !important;
        }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.opt_btn_text_selected != blank %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn--secondary[aria-pressed="true"],
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options .btn--secondary.color__bg-selected-1 {
          color: {{ block.settings.opt_btn_text_selected }} !important;
        }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.mb_d and block.settings.mb_d > 0 %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_d }}px; }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.mb_m and block.settings.mb_m > 0 %}
        @media (max-width: 749px) { #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .options { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_m }}px; } }
      {% endif %}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ----- Add (quantity + ATC) block ----- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.type == 'add' -%}
      /* Quantity selector */
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-qty-box {
        {% if block.settings.qty_border_width and block.settings.qty_border_width > 0 %}border-width: {{ block.settings.qty_border_width }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.qty_border_color != blank %}border-color: {{ block.settings.qty_border_color }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.qty_radius and block.settings.qty_radius > 0 %}border-radius: {{ block.settings.qty_radius }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.qty_height and block.settings.qty_height > 0 %}height: {{ block.settings.qty_height }}px !important;{% endif %}
      }
      /* Add to Cart button */
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-atc-btn {
        {% case block.settings.btn_font %}
          {% when 'body'        %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
          {% when 'heading'     %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
          {% when 'handwritten' %}font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family) !important;
        {% endcase %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_size_d and block.settings.btn_size_d > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.btn_size_d }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_weight != blank %}font-weight: {{ block.settings.btn_weight }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_case != blank %}text-transform: {{ block.settings.btn_case }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_ls != blank %}letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.btn_ls }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_pad_v and block.settings.btn_pad_v > 0 %}padding-top: {{ block.settings.btn_pad_v }}px !important; padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.btn_pad_v }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_pad_h and block.settings.btn_pad_h > 0 %}padding-left: {{ block.settings.btn_pad_h }}px !important; padding-right: {{ block.settings.btn_pad_h }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_radius and block.settings.btn_radius > 0 %}border-radius: {{ block.settings.btn_radius }}px !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_border_width and block.settings.btn_border_width > 0 %}border-width: {{ block.settings.btn_border_width }}px !important; border-style: solid !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_bg != blank %}background: {{ block.settings.btn_bg }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_text != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.btn_text }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_border_color != blank %}border-color: {{ block.settings.btn_border_color }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-atc-btn:hover {
        {% if block.settings.btn_bg_hover != blank %}background: {{ block.settings.btn_bg_hover }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_text_hover != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.btn_text_hover }} !important;{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.btn_border_hover != blank %}border-color: {{ block.settings.btn_border_hover }} !important;{% endif %}
      }
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-atc-btn {
          {% if block.settings.btn_size_m and block.settings.btn_size_m > 0 %}font-size: {{ block.settings.btn_size_m }}px !important;{% endif %}
        }
      }
      {% if block.settings.btn_fullwidth_d == false %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-atc-btn { width: auto !important; }
      {% endif %}
      @media (max-width: 749px) {
        {% if block.settings.btn_fullwidth_m == false %}
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-atc-btn { width: auto !important; }
        {% endif %}
      }
      {% if block.settings.mb_d and block.settings.mb_d > 0 %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-atc-wrap { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_d }}px; }
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.mb_m and block.settings.mb_m > 0 %}
        @media (max-width: 749px) { #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-atc-wrap { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mb_m }}px; } }
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.enable_sticky_mobile %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-sticky-bar {
          position: fixed;
          left: 0;
          right: 0;
          bottom: 0;
          z-index: 50;
          padding: {{ block.settings.sticky_pad_v_mobile | default: 12 }}px {{ block.settings.sticky_pad_h_mobile | default: 16 }}px;
          padding-bottom: calc({{ block.settings.sticky_pad_v_mobile | default: 12 }}px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
          {% if block.settings.sticky_bg_mobile != blank %}background: {{ block.settings.sticky_bg_mobile }};{% else %}background: var(--color-bg-body, #ffffff);{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.sticky_shadow_mobile %}box-shadow: 0 -4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08);{% endif %}
          transform: translateY(100%);
          opacity: 0;
          visibility: hidden;
          pointer-events: none;
          /* Tighter hide timing (was 280ms) so fast scroll-to-top
           * doesn't leave the bar visibly mid-animation when the
           * page finishes scrolling. visibility delay matches the
           * shorter transform so the bar truly is hidden right after
           * the slide-down completes. */
          transition: transform 160ms cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1), opacity 140ms ease-out, visibility 0s linear 160ms;
          will-change: transform, opacity;
          display: none;
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-sticky-bar__inner {
          display: flex;
          align-items: stretch;
          gap: 8px;
          width: 100%;
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-sticky-bar.is-visible {
          transform: translateY(0);
          opacity: 1;
          visibility: visible;
          pointer-events: auto;
          transition: transform 220ms cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1), opacity 180ms ease-out, visibility 0s linear 0s;
        }
        @media (max-width: 749px) {
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-sticky-bar { display: block; }
        }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-sticky-bar,
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-sticky-bar.is-visible {
            transition: opacity 120ms linear, visibility 0s linear 0s;
            transform: none;
          }
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-sticky-bar:not(.is-visible) { opacity: 0; }
        }
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.enable_trust_icons %}
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-trust-icons {
          display: flex;
          {% if block.settings.trust_icons_layout == 'vertical' %}
            flex-direction: column;
          {% else %}
            flex-direction: row;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
          {% endif %}
          align-items: center;
          {% case block.settings.trust_icons_align %}
            {% when 'left' %}justify-content: flex-start;
            {% when 'right' %}justify-content: flex-end;
            {% else %}justify-content: center;
          {% endcase %}
          gap: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_gap | default: 16 }}px;
          margin-top: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_mt_d | default: 12 }}px;
          padding: 0 16px;
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-trust-icon {
          display: inline-flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: {{ block.settings.trust_icon_inner_gap | default: 6 }}px;
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-trust-icon-img {
          width: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_size | default: 18 }}px;
          height: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_size | default: 18 }}px;
          object-fit: contain;
          flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        /* Lucide-icon variant of the trust glyph — matches the size of
           the uploaded-image variant above and inherits stroke color
           from the label color so the icon + label read as one unit. */
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-trust-icon-glyph {
          display: inline-flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: center;
          flex-shrink: 0;
          width: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_size | default: 18 }}px;
          height: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_size | default: 18 }}px;
          {% if block.settings.trust_icons_label_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_label_color }};{% endif %}
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-trust-icon-glyph svg {
          width: 100%;
          height: 100%;
        }
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-trust-icon-label {
          font-size: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_label_size | default: 12 }}px;
          {% if block.settings.trust_icons_label_color != blank %}color: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_label_color }};{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.trust_icons_label_weight != blank %}font-weight: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_label_weight }};{% endif %}
          {% case block.settings.trust_icons_label_font %}
            {% when 'body' %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family);
            {% when 'heading' %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family);
            {% when 'handwritten' %}font-family: var(--type-font-handwritten-family);
          {% endcase %}
        }
        @media (max-width: 749px) {
          #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-trust-icons {
            margin-top: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_mt_m | default: 12 }}px;
            gap: {{ block.settings.trust_icons_gap_m | default: 12 }}px;
          }
        }
      {% endif %}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ----- Description block ----- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.type == 'description' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pdp-description-header {
        {% case block.settings.desc_title_font %}
          {% when 'body'        %}font-family: var(--type-font-body-family) !important;
          {% when 'heading'     %}font-family: var(--type-font-header-family) !important;
